            "0": "A traveler arrived two days ago who spotted some of these creatures near Nirra Hamlett.  And one of my scouts brought back a map he found on one of the creatures he killed in the forest.  The map was of Nirra Hamlett.\n\nI believe an attack on the hamlett is imminent, but I do not have the men to spare and still keep a watch on the growing evil in the lands."
